y suitability for employment. If I am employed by Rexius I agree to any drug/alcohol testing the Company may require under its Alcohol and Drug Policy. If the laboratory finds the test invalid, and if the laboratory, Medical Review Officer or Rexius believe another test is appropriate, I agree to submit another specimen(s) for further testing. I understand that I will not be informed of the results of my pre-employment drug test unless I request it within 60 days of being notified of the disposition of my application. ","type":"control_signature"},"261":{"name":"availableStart261","order":"16","text":"Available Start Date","type":"control_datetime"},"263":{"name":"address","order":"18","text":"Address","type":"control_address"},"264":{"name":"phoneNumber264","order":"19","text":"Phone Number","type":"control_phone"},"265":{"name":"alternatePhone265","order":"21","text":"Alternate Phone Number","type":"control_phone"},"266":{"name":"phoneType","options":{"Cell":"Cell","Home":"Home"},"order":"20","text":"Phone Type","type":"control_radio"},"267":{"name":"phoneType267","options":{"Cell":"Cell","Home":"Home"},"order":"22","text":"Phone Type","type":"control_radio"},"268":{"name":"name268","options":{"Craigslist.com":"Craigslist.com","Facebook":"Facebook","Google":"Google","I am a Previous Employee":"I am a Previous Employee","Indeed.com":"Indeed.com","Other":"Other","Rexius.com":"Rexius.com","Walk In":"Walk In"},"order":"8","text":"How did you learn about this job position?","type":"control_checkbox"},"272":{"name":"haveYou","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"11","text":"Have you ever worked for Rexius or its affiliates before?","type":"control_radio"},"273":{"name":"ifYes273","order":"12","text":"If yes, please give dates of employment, location, and job title.","type":"control_textarea"},"274":{"name":"haveYou274","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"13","text":"Have you ever applied for work with Rexius or its affiliates before?","type":"control_radio"},"275":{"name":"ifYes275","order":"14","text":"If yes, please give date, location, and job for which you applied.","type":"control_textarea"},"276":{"name":"youMay276","order":"78","text":"You may comment on any other special qualifications you have related to this job or this company. ","type":"control_textarea"},"280":{"name":"location","order":"44","text":"Location","type":"control_textbox"},"287":{"name":"locationUbicacion287","order":"68","text":"Location","type":"control_textbox"},"30":{"name":"driverLicense30","order":"30","text":"Driver License number","type":"control_textbox"},"31":{"name":"expirationDate31","order":"31","text":"Expiration Date","type":"control_datetime"},"311":{"name":"areYou","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"25","text":"Are you at least 18 years of Age?","type":"control_radio"},"312":{"name":"canYou","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"26","text":"Can you, upon hiring, provide appropriate identification documenting and verifying your identity and your legal right to work in the USA?","type":"control_radio"},"313":{"name":"regardingThejob313","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"83","text":"Can you fulfill the job duties and responsibilities of the position(s) for which you are applying as they have been described to you through our written job description(s), with or without a reasonable accommodation?","type":"control_radio"},"322":{"name":"rexiusBelieves322","options":{"No":"No","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"97","text":"Rexius believes that use of drugs or alcohol in the workplace is an unsafe work practice and creates increased risk to the consumer, fellow employees, customers and the public. Rexius is a Drug-Free and Alcohol-Free workplace. Use of illegal substances or abuse of controlled substances may result in disciplinary action or termination of employment.If employed, do you agree to abide by the Rexius Drug-Free and Alcohol-Free workplace standards?","type":"control_radio"},"323":{"name":"ifPresently","options":{"No":"No","Unemployed/NA":"Unemployed/NA","Yes":"Yes"},"order":"42","text":"If presently employed, may we contact your current employer to verify employment?","type":"control_radio"},"324":{"name":"initials","order":"88","text":"Initials","type":"control_textbox"},"325":{"name":"ltpgtltspanStylefontweight","order":"89","text":"Term, Condition, Expectation and/or Agreement\r\nIn the event that I am requested to undergo a medical examination or evaluation as a part of the job placement process of the Company, I agree to supply only information which is true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\r\nIf the Company determines that I have made any false oral or written statements, misrepresentations or omissions of material information to them or to the physician or their representative, the Company is entitled to rescind my conditional offer of employment or terminate my employment at any time.","type":"control_text"},"326":{"name":"initials326","order":"90","text":"Initials","type":"control_textbox"},"327":{"name":"ltpgtltspanStylefontweight327","order":"91","text":"Term, Condition, Expectation and/or Agreement\nI authorize any person, school, current employer, past employer, physician or organization with knowledge of me or my work to provide the Company or its agent or representative with any information or opinion about me in response to an inquiry by the Company.\nI release any such person, employer, physician or organization from any legal liability in making such statements or furnishing any and all information to the Company or to its representative or agent.","type":"control_text"},"328":{"name":"initials328","order":"92","text":"Initials","type":"control_textbox"},"329":{"name":"ltpgtltspanStylefontweight329","order":"93","text":"Term, Condition, Expectation and/or Agreement\r\nI authorize the Company, its agents, or representatives to check references regarding my employment and investigate any of the statements or answers provided by me on this application